  "body": "<h1>NBA DFS Rankings for Saturday, November 14 (DraftKings)</h1>\n<p class=\"meta\">DraftKings main slate · <strong>Saturday, November 14</strong> · 5 games · First game 7:00 PM ET · By <strong>Chris Spags</strong> · <!--@@SLATE-PUBLISHED@@--> · Numbers as of <time datetime=\"2026-11-14T11:50:43-05:00\">November 14, 11:50 AM ET</time></p>\n<p>Nikola Jokic (DEN) ranks first on the Saturday, November 14 DraftKings main slate at 64.6 projected DraftKings points for $11,700. Giannis Antetokounmpo (MIA, 53.6) and Cade Cunningham (DET, 50.7) are next.</p>\n<p>The table ranks all 75 players in the run by SPAGS projection, with DraftKings salary and projected points per $1,000.</p>\n<p>Every projection is a SPAGS model estimate from the November 14, 11:50 AM ET run of the Splash Play NBA model. This page updates each time the main-slate numbers are run, and NBA projections move with every injury report, so check the time above before you build.</p>\n<!-- SLOT:OFFER-TOP -->\n<!--@@SLATE-OFFER@@-->\n<style>@media(max-width:480px){.tw.nb th,.tw.nb td{padding-left:5px!important;padding-right:5px!important}.tw.nb th:first-child,.tw.nb td:first-child{padding-left:9px!important}}</style>\n<h2>DraftKings rankings by projection, Nov 14</h2>\n<div class=\"tw nb\"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Player</th><th>Salary</th><th>SPAGS proj</th><th>Pts/$1K</th><th>Pos</th><th>Team</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/nikola-jokic/\">Nikola Jokic</a></td><td>$11,700</td><td class=\"num\">64.6</td><td class=\"num\">5.52</td><td>C</td><td>DEN</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/giannis-antetokounmpo/\">Giannis Antetokounmpo</a></td><td>$11,500</td><td class=\"num\">53.6</td><td class=\"num\">4.66</td><td>PF</td><td>MIA</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/cade-cunningham/\">Cade Cunningham</a></td><td>$9,800</td><td class=\"num\">50.7</td><td class=\"num\">5.17</td><td>PG</td><td>DET</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><